    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12330" root="در" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرِيرٌ</span></b>  A horse (S, K) or similar beast (K, TA)
that is <i>swift:</i> (S, K:) or <i>swift in running, and
compact in make:</i> (TA:) or <i>compact and firm
in make.</i> (K, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرِّىٌّ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَدِرٌّ</span>.] ＝ 
 
